"""Authentication for the security schemes in the spec. Generated by APIForge; do not edit.

These dependencies read the credential where the spec says it is; whether it is valid is
decided in app/auth.py, which is yours. They never refuse a request themselves: each route
calls require() with its alternatives, which decides between 401 and 403 once it has seen
every credential.

A requirement whose scheme APIForge cannot check (HTTP digest, mutual TLS, ...) depends on
unsupported(), which always answers 401. To accept such requests, check the credential
yourself and replace it in app/main.py:
``app.dependency_overrides[security.unsupported] = your_check``.
"""

